'''River Acheron''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and appears on the 11th, 12th, 25th and 26th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|River Styx]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]], Bullet Train Cat.

